41
00:01:59,389 --> 00:02:01,186
Company Memory by AI 4 SALE.

42
00:02:01,186 --> 00:02:03,283
Your knowledge, ready for the next conversation.

43
00:02:04,083 --> 00:02:06,296
Now, here is how to check the plugin.

44
00:02:06,296 --> 00:02:09,338
Use the reviewer account supplied privately, install Company Memory, and connect.

45
00:02:09,338 --> 00:02:12,104
Choose Pilot shared memory, General, and read plus submit access.

46
00:02:12,104 --> 00:02:15,699
We will show what to ask, what should happen, and what to inspect.

47
00:02:16,499 --> 00:02:19,592
Ask to connect and show the memory and zones you approved.

48
00:02:19,592 --> 00:02:21,841
Follow the connection link and approve your selection.

49
00:02:21,841 --> 00:02:24,652
The account result should show Pilot shared memory and General.

50
00:02:24,652 --> 00:02:28,307
Check that connecting uses this existing memory and does not create another workspace.

51
00:02:29,107 --> 00:02:32,304
Ask for the reviewer setup note and open its current source.

52
00:02:32,304 --> 00:02:35,500
Search should return the note; fetch should open that exact result.

53
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:38,697
Check the sample facts: project Aurora, owner Nia, and blue labels.

54
00:02:38,697 --> 00:02:42,475
Inspect the source reference and version, rather than relying on an unsupported answer.

55
00:02:43,275 --> 00:02:46,820
Select the sample conclusion shown here and ask to save it in General.

56
00:02:46,820 --> 00:02:50,092
The plugin first retrieves context, then submits the selected text for review.

57
00:02:50,092 --> 00:02:51,183
Check the returned job.

58
00:02:51,183 --> 00:02:52,819
Queued means it is still processing.

59
00:02:52,819 --> 00:02:56,091
Count it as published only when the result is accepted and visible.

60
00:02:56,891 --> 00:03:00,415
After the previous result is accepted, start a new conversation and request it again.

61
00:03:00,415 --> 00:03:01,926
Do not paste the old chat.

62
00:03:01,926 --> 00:03:04,695
Check that a fresh search and fetch return the accepted conclusion.

63
00:03:04,695 --> 00:03:08,219
Compare its content and source hash with the published result from the previous step.

64
00:03:09,019 --> 00:03:12,273
Reconnect the approved client and ask for the same reviewer source.

65
00:03:12,273 --> 00:03:14,344
A session refresh keeps its approved scope.

66
00:03:14,344 --> 00:03:18,485
If the client starts a new authorization, explicitly approve the same memory and zone.

67
00:03:18,485 --> 00:03:21,148
Then fetch the note and compare its source hash.

68
00:03:21,148 --> 00:03:22,627
The knowledge should remain unchanged.

69
00:03:23,427 --> 00:03:25,591
Ask: what is seventeen multiplied by twenty-four?

70
00:03:25,591 --> 00:03:27,755
The answer is four hundred and eight.

71
00:03:27,755 --> 00:03:32,084
Inspect the tool activity: there should be no Company Memory call, connection request, search,

72
00:03:32,084 --> 00:03:32,702
or save.

73
00:03:32,702 --> 00:03:33,939
This question is self-contained.

74
00:03:34,739 --> 00:03:37,390
Ask to translate: the meeting starts at nine, into French.

75
00:03:37,390 --> 00:03:40,572
Expect a direct translation, such as: la réunion commence à neuf heures.

76
00:03:40,572 --> 00:03:44,018
Check that the assistant does not search your workspace or save the sentence.

77
00:03:44,018 --> 00:03:46,139
It already has all the text it needs.

78
00:03:46,939 --> 00:03:49,559
Ask why the Moon has phases, in two sentences.

79
00:03:49,559 --> 00:03:53,634
Expect an explanation about the changing view of its sunlit half as it orbits

80
00:03:53,634 --> 00:03:53,925
Earth.

81
00:03:53,925 --> 00:03:55,962
Check that no Company Memory tools run.

82
00:03:55,962 --> 00:03:58,291
No company-specific information is needed for this answer.

83
00:03:59,091 --> 00:04:01,640
These eight prompts give you a repeatable walkthrough.

84
00:04:01,640 --> 00:04:04,826
For memory tasks, inspect the actual tool results and source.

85
00:04:04,826 --> 00:04:07,376
For unrelated questions, confirm that memory stays untouched.

86
00:04:07,376 --> 00:04:09,925
The complete product guide is on our website.

87
00:04:09,925 --> 00:04:11,837
Company Memory by AI 4 SALE.

88
